Description:
    TxDb.Athaliana.Ensembl.TAIR10 provides transcript, exon, CDS, and gene 
    annotations for Arabidopsis thaliana based on the TAIR10 reference genome 
    and Ensembl Plants release 63. The TxDb object is built from the Ensembl 
    Plants GFF3 annotation and can be queried using GenomicFeatures accessors 
    such as genes(), transcripts(), exonsBy(), and cdsBy().
